# pip-audit ignore list — Refugio Animal Paraguay
#
# Format: one OSV/GHSA/CVE ID per line.
# Always include a comment explaining WHY the vulnerability is suppressed:
#   - Is it a transitive dep with no fix available?
#   - Is it unexploitable in our deployment context?
#   - Is there a mitigating control already in place?
#
# Example (DO NOT uncomment unless the vulnerability is real):
# GHSA-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx  # transitive via package-x, no fix available as of 2026-03-29

# pip vulnerabilities (2026-04-13) - These are in pip's tar extraction,
# not in application code. Only affect package installation, not runtime.
# Fix requires upgrading pip to 25.3+, but Poetry handles dependency resolution.
CVE-2025-8869  # pip tar extraction, not exploitable in our deployment context
CVE-2026-1703  # pip wheel extraction, mitigated by Poetry package manager
GHSA-4xh5-x5gv-qwph  # alias for CVE-2025-8869
